{"id":"109d01fe15884218","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-measurable.md","title":"Measurable Cardinal","display":"df-measurable — Measurable Cardinal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-measurable","aliases":["58-df-measurable"],"display":"df-measurable — Measurable Cardinal","depends_on":["[[../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-nonprincipal.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-measurable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-measurable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-measurable — Measurable Cardinal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md\">../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3e4a39dd9e2f4f00\" href=\"?note=3e4a39dd9e2f4f00\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-nonprincipal.md\">../batch15/58-df-nonprincipal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,U\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,U\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\">\\(U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md\">../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NonPrincipal}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{NonPrincipal}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3e4a39dd9e2f4f00\" href=\"?note=3e4a39dd9e2f4f00\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-nonprincipal.md\">../batch15/58-df-nonprincipal.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KappaCompleteUltrafilter}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{KappaCompleteUltrafilter}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measurable}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Measurable}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>交在固定载体 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 内计算；空族的交为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>，不调用无载体的空族广义交。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kappa\\text{-}complete\\text{-}ultrafilter}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{KappaCompleteUltrafilter}_S(U,\\kappa)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,\\kappa)\n\\land\\forall\\mathcal A\\subseteq U\\;\n\\bigl(|\\mathcal A|&lt;\\kappa\\to\\{x\\in\\kappa:\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;x\\in A\\}\\in U\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kappa\\text{-}complete\\text{-}ultrafilter}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{KappaCompleteUltrafilter}_S(U,\\kappa)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,\\kappa)\n\\land\\forall\\mathcal A\\subseteq U\\;\n\\bigl(|\\mathcal A|&lt;\\kappa\\to\\{x\\in\\kappa:\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;x\\in A\\}\\in U\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}measurable}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Measurable}(\\kappa)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\n\\land\\exists U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{KappaCompleteUltrafilter}_S(U,\\kappa)\n\\land\\mathrm{NonPrincipal}_S(U,\\kappa)\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}measurable}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Measurable}(\\kappa)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\n\\land\\exists U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{KappaCompleteUltrafilter}_S(U,\\kappa)\n\\land\\mathrm{NonPrincipal}_S(U,\\kappa)\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The direct upstream κ-completeness atom defines completeness of ideals, not ultrafilters; intersection closure is therefore stated explicitly here.</li>\n<li>Such an ultrafilter is often called a measure on all subsets of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>, explaining the terminology.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md","status":"resolved","id":"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-nonprincipal.md","status":"resolved","id":"3e4a39dd9e2f4f00","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excer